<p>Karbala waale hamei'n darse wafa dete hai<br />
Teer par teer chale phir bhi dua dete hai</p>

<p>Haaye naana teri ummat me zara rehm nahi'n<br />
Ghar se mehmaan bulaakar wo dagha dete hai</p>

<p>Ab na maangenge kabhi paani chacha lout aao<br />
sookhe hulqoom se maasoom sada dete hai</p>

<p>qaid wo qaid ke sone bhi na paaye Aabid<br />
jab bhi sote hai to zanjeer hila dete hai</p>

<p>Tum ne qurbaan kiye phool se masoomo'n ko<br />
apne phoole phale gulshan ko luta dete hai<br />
</p>